#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:1
msgid "E4218"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `lexscan_pattern_not_anchored`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:5
msgid "A lexical regex pattern is not anchored where anchoring is required."
msgstr "词法正则模式没有在要求锚定的位置进行锚定。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:7
msgid ""
"Patterns used by streaming `lexscan`, or by either expression with the "
"`longest` strategy, must start at the current input position. Anchor each"
" such regex with `^`."
msgstr "流式 `lexscan` 使用的模式，以及任一表达式在 `longest` 策略下使用的模式，都必须从当前输入位置开始。请使用 `^` 锚定每个这样的正则。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:11
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:13
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn classify(input : String) -> String {\n"
"  lexmatch input with longest {\n"
"    re\"[a-z]+\" => \"word\"\n"
"    _ => \"other\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:17
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:19
msgid ""
"Add `^` to the start of the regex. Add `$` as well only when the case "
"must consume the whole input."
msgstr "在正则开头添加 `^`。只有当 case 必须消耗整个输入时，才还需要添加 `$`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:22
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn classify(input : String) -> String {\n"
"  lexmatch input with longest {\n"
"    (re\"^[a-z]+\", after=_) => \"word\"\n"
"    _ => \"other\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
